 decoder creation. r=mattwoodrow, a=lizzard\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D21477", "files": ["dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp", "dom/media/MediaPrefs.h", "dom/media/platforms/wmf/WMFDecoderModule.cpp", "gfx/src/DriverCrashGuard.cpp", "gfx/src/DriverCrashGuard.h", "gfx/thebes/gfxPrefs.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "106ef72890390f660dc47b68806bbc38607b7705", "parents": ["a096a8ee118db4fcd39b7dbf4e963c96a795bb4b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jean-Yves Avenard \u003cjyavenard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1521370 - Do not attempt to retry crash guard once a crash occurred. r=mattwoodrow, a=lizzard\n\nShould the configuration had changed at startup, a crash guard would have always been re-attempted even if a new crash occurred.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D22623", "files": ["gfx/src/DriverCrashGuard.cpp", "gfx/src/DriverCrashGuard.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8ab00f88875e2c5e52c6006cef49a5655fef96d4", "parents": ["106ef72890390f660dc47b68806bbc38607b7705"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jean-Yves Avenard \u003cjyavenard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1521370 - Always enable WMF VPX crashguard on Nightly. r=mattwoodrow, a=lizzard\n\nThere's nothing to get around it unfortunately, making firefox unusable without it.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D22874", "files": ["gfx/src/DriverCrashGuard.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1284882e1b3c71b8e54bff50484ef8ea28878e5e", "parents": ["8ab00f88875e2c5e52c6006cef49a5655fef96d4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jean-Yves Avenard \u003cjyavenard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1521370 - Ensure WMF PDM is always initialized on the right thread. r=mattwoodrow,gerald, a=lizzard\n\nAnd only do it once.\n\nDepends on D22874\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D23247", "files": ["dom/media/ipc/VideoDecoderParent.cpp", "dom/media/platforms/PDMFactory.cpp", "dom/media/platforms/PDMFactory.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c051c5c4282ce077eab01738b4c548306ab991c4", "parents": ["1284882e1b3c71b8e54bff50484ef8ea28878e5e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1556903269, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "405": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dana Keeler \u003cdkeeler@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1549010 - verify add-on signing certificates at 2019-04-27T02:43:20.000Z r=jcj a=lizzard\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D29928", "files": ["security/apps/AppSignatureVerification.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "635f3d3ecab0b5d10a101624e774dd5785320e65", "parents": ["c051c5c4282ce077eab01738b4c548306ab991c4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kris Maglione \u003cmaglione.k@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1549010: Part 2 - Bump DB schema version to force certificate reverification. r=zombie a=lizzard CLOSED TREE\n\nUsers who are affected by the intermediate add-on signing certificate expiry\nneed their add-on signatures re-verified as soon as possible after updating to\na version containging the fix. A database rebuild includes signature\nreverifications, so a schema version achieves this.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D29932", "files": ["toolkit/mozapps/extensions/internal/XPIProvider.jsm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "18a1c7a770e6317535bd4bd29d5097feecb7559f", "parents": ["635f3d3ecab0b5d10a101624e774dd5785320e65"], "tags": []}], "date": 1556947136, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "maglione.k@gmail.com"}, "406": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dana Keeler \u003cdkeeler@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_60_6_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1549010 - verify add-on signing certificates at 2019-04-27T02:43:20.000Z r=jcj a=lizzard\n\nDifferential Revisio